[{"text":"FCLoopFindTopologyMappings[{topo1, topo2, ...}] finds mappings between topologies (written as FCTopology objects) topo1, topo2, .... For each source topology the function returns a list of loop momentum shifts and a GLI replacement rule needed to map it to the given target topology. If you need to map everything to a particular set of target topologies, you can specify them via the PreferredTopologies option.","anchor":"fcloopfindtopologymappings"},{"text":"The output is a list of two lists, the former containing the mappings and the latter enumerating the final contributing topologies","anchor":"fcloopfindtopologymappings"},{"text":"To enable shifts in the external momenta you need to set the option Momentum to All.","anchor":"fcloopfindtopologymappings"},{"text":"Overview, FCTopology, GLI, FCLoopFindTopologies.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"Here we have a set of 5 topologies","anchor":"examples","section":"Examples"},{"text":"topos1 = { FCTopology[fctopology1, {SFAD[{{p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 + p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p2 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}]}, {p1, p2, p3}, {Q}, {}, {}], FCTopology[fctopology2, {SFAD[{{p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 + p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p2 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p2 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}]}, {p1, p2, p3}, {Q}, {}, {}], FCTopology[fctopology3, {SFAD[{{p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 + p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p3, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p2 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0, 1}, 1}], SFAD[{{p1 + p2 + p3 - Q, 0}, {0,